.TH RGBSEC-DATA 1 "2026-08-19" "rgbdns 0.6.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rgbsec-data \- sign and compile an rgbdns DNSSEC snapshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rgbsec-data
.RI [ data
.RI [ data.cdb ]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Performs the bounded offline signing transform of
.BR rgbsec-sign (1)
and compiles the result directly to a CDB. It reads
.I dnssec
in the working directory and replaces the destination only after the new CDB
has been written, synchronized, and successfully reloaded.
.PP
K zones are signed; explicit U zones retain their unsigned records, locations,
cutoffs, and ANAME directives.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on success, 100 for usage errors, and 111 for operational failures.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rgbsec-sign (1),
.BR rgbsec-check (1),
.BR tinydns-data (1)
